  "description": "Reads a DeepSharp pipeline's rows out of a folder of recordings, a folder to each class: .ReadSounds(path, shape) in the chain, read.sounds in a pipeline file, replayed like any other file the pipeline reads. WAV files, each one row whose samples are one cell of a fixed length, channel count and rate that the step says — a recording of another length, channels or rate is refused and never cut, mixed or resampled — and the class the name of its folder, with a column of nought and one for each class a learner is handed the answer by.",
